@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain
skinparam ArrowColor #C62828
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #C62828
skinparam ArrowThickness 2title Edit a student's group labels
box "Logic" #C8C8FA
participant ":LogicManager" as Logic LOGIC_COLOR
participant ":AddressBookParser" as Parser LOGIC_COLOR
participant "edit:EditCommand" as Command LOGIC_COLOR
end box
box "Model" #F97181
participant "pending:ModelManager" as Pending MODEL_COLOR
participant "book:ReadOnlyAddressBook" as Book MODEL_COLOR
end box
[-> Logic : execute(input)
activate Logic
Logic -> Parser : parseCommand(input)
activate Parser
Parser --> Logic : command
deactivate Parser
note over Logic
Capture records, preferences, and current filter.
end note
create Pending
Logic -> Pending : new ModelManager(records, preferences)
Logic -> Pending : updateFilteredPersonList(filter)
Logic -> Command : execute(pending)
activate Command
Command -> Command : findStudent(pending)
activate Command
Command -> Pending : getAddressBook()
Pending --> Command : book
Command -> Book : getPersonList()
Book --> Command : students
Command --> Command : student
deactivate Command
note over Command
Select the student by ID. Build an edited Person,
removing tutorial 1 and adding tutorial 2.
Keep the Student ID, attendance, and unspecified fields.
(Internal validation and object construction omitted.)
end note
Command -> Pending : setPerson(student, updatedStudent)
Command -> Pending : updateFilteredPersonList(PREDICATE_SHOW_ALL_PERSONS)
Command --> Logic : result
deactivate Command
note over Logic, Pending
Save pending records before publishing to the live model.
See the shared transaction diagram for these omitted calls.
end note
[<-- Logic : result
deactivate Logic
@enduml
